  "method": "Previous untouched-paper deck of four development maps/two seats/three windows. Use only preaction public observations. Assign distance 0, 1 or 2 by (window index + seat + map index) modulo 3 before looking at model outputs. Within that distance maximize number of affordable worker-tree pairs and remaining productive lifespan, then earliest turn. Retain empty windows. No new model, marks, enemy commands or future views in selection.",
